WEBVTT

00:14:57.441 --> 00:15:01.214
nothing is so urgent as sitting still.

00:15:01.214 --> 00:15:03.443
So you can go on your next vacation

00:15:03.443 --> 00:15:06.509
to Paris or Hawaii, or New Orleans;

00:15:06.509 --> 00:15:10.049
I bet you'll have a wonderful time.

00:15:10.049 --> 00:15:15.117
But, if you want to come back home
alive and full of fresh hope,

00:15:15.117 --> 00:15:17.277
in love with the world,

00:15:17.277 --> 00:15:21.713
I think you might want
to try considering going nowhere.

00:15:21.713 --> 00:15:22.860
Thank you.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.131
(Applause)